<title>UK: Granada, Carlton up on UK digital TV hopes.</title>
<headline>Granada, Carlton up on UK digital TV hopes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Granada Plc and Carlton Communications Plc defied a weakening market on Tuesday on hopes their joint venture British Digital Broadcasting  BDB would be awarded a licence for digital terrestrial broadcasting.</p>
<p>By 0815 GMT Carlton was up 8-1/2p at 525p while Granada gained 7p to 842p.</p>
</text>
